    id: 'thread5-replay-conflict-seq',
    label: 'verify:thread5-replay-conflict',
    prompt: `${COMMON}

FINDING (CodeRabbit Major, crates/fuse/src/replay.rs around 657-668, fn publish_child_folder_metadata):
